plate":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["angular","javascript","pwa","typescript","web","web-framework","web-performance"],"visibility":"public","forks":27110,"open_issues":1141,"watchers":100153,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"<!--\r\nIF YOU DON'T FILL OUT THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION WE MIGHT CLOSE YOUR ISSUE WITHOUT INVESTIGATING\r\n-->\r\n\r\n**I'm submitting a ...**  (check one with \"x\")\r\n```\r\n[x] bug report => search github for a similar issue or PR before submitting\r\n[ ] feature request\r\n[ ] support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Current behavior**\r\n\r\nWhen buffer limitation that causes #16829 is fixed, it becomes evident that `gulp validate-commit-messages` processes all existing commits from `master` when being run locally, down to `Initial commit`.\r\n\r\nThis results in error:\r\n\r\n```\r\nExamining 7544 commits between HEAD and master\r\nINVALID COMMIT MSG: \"Initial commit\"\r\n => ERROR: The commit message does not match the format of \"<type>(<scope>): <subject> OR revert: type(<scope>): <subject>\"\r\nPlease fix the failing commit messages before continuing...\r\nCommit message guidelines: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-commit-message-guidelines\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nOnly newer commits from currently checked out branch (HEAD) and `master` should be checked.\r\n\r\n**Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions**\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit clone https://github.com/angular/angular\r\ncd ./angular\r\nnpm i\r\ngulp validate-commit-messages\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit clone https://github.com/bisubus/angular\r\ncd ./angular\r\nnpm i\r\ngit checkout fix-windows-symlinks-2\r\ngulp validate-commit-messages\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Please tell us about your environment:**\r\n<!-- Operating system, IDE, package manager, HTTP server, ... -->\r\nWindows 7 x64\r\nNode 6.10.3\r\nNPM 3.10.10\r\ngit 2.9.0.windows.1\r\n\r\n* **Angular version:** 4.2.0-beta.1\r\n<!-- Check whether this is still an issue in the most recent Angular version -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/16830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/16830/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1087015454,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDEwODcwMTU0NTQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1087015454","actor":{"login":"jasonaden","id":516168,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/516168?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonaden","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-05-18T01:39:12Z","label":{"name":"comp: build & ci","color":"c7def8"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":1366757740,"node_id":"MDEy